function [area, perim] = ring_section(bx, n)
%RING_SECTION  The area [m^2] and perimeter [m] of the cross-section of a centred box of sides bx [m] by the plane through its centre
%   with unit normal n.
%   bx: real[1][3] (passed a plain number)
